      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The City Council is scheduled to vote next Tuesday on the proposed downtown congestion pricing zone. This plan would charge drivers a fee for entering the core during busy hours, with the primary goal of reducing traffic and lowering emissions citywide. While the initiative aims for cleaner roads, it is important to note that local businesses have raised concerns regarding potential impacts on commuters and customers. We encourage all residents to review the details before the important vote.",
